      "narrative": null,
      "content": "WHO/CDS/AIDS/86.1\npage 2\n\n5. Guidance for health professionals\n\n5.1* Screening\n5.2* Diagnostic testing\n5.3% Counselling of seropositive persone\n\n6. Guidance for high risk groups and the general population\n\n6.1* Prevention of sexual transmission\n6,2* Pravention of parenteral transmission\n6.3* Education and foster care\n\n7, Disinfection and sterilization\n\n1 Commonly available disinfectants\n\n-2 Sterilization\n\n.3 Processing needles and syringes\n\n.4* Care of eye examination instruments and contact lenses,",
      "truncated": false,
      "provenance": "ingested",
      "summary": {
        "status": "draft",
        "text": "Continues the contents of the 1986 LAV/HTLV-III guidelines, listing planned sections on guidance for health professionals, high-risk groups and the general population, and disinfection and sterilization.",
